.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# Local signing material. The debug keystore lives inside /android, which is
# prebuild output and gets wiped by `expo prebuild --clean` — and its SHA-256 is
# registered on the production Firebase app for phone auth, so losing it means
# re-registering a fresh fingerprint by hand. Backed up here so a rebuild cannot
# destroy it. NEVER commit it: anyone holding it can sign an app Firebase trusts.
/.local-signing
